# FO-1: rename, fleet-to-fleet fuel and cargo, split, Merge Fleets, two-fleet exchange (deep space).
# Fleets at the deep-space point: 1 (3 Hauler, 2 Looker), 2 (2 Hauler, cargo), 3 (1 Hauler), 4 (1 Looker).
fleet first
# Next from fleet 0 went to the highest fleet number (fleet 4) in exploration
fleet next
fleet rename Picket
# others of fleet 4: 1, 2, 3
fleet other 0
fleet goto
# on fleet 1; others: 2, 3, 4
fleet other 1
fleet cargo
xfer fuel 50
xfer ok
fleet other 0
fleet cargo
xfer fuel -30
xfer ir -10
xfer ok
fleet split
ships 0 1
ships 1 1
ships ok
# fleets here: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (new); merge fleet 4 into fleet 1
fleet merge 3
fleet other 0
fleet exchange
ships 0 -1
ships ok
